WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.630
A roof rests on five columns.

2
00:00:02.680 --> 00:00:05.920
Take one away, and what
happens to the building?

3
00:00:05.970 --> 00:00:10.530
Muslims report that the Prophet
said Islam is built on five.

4
00:00:10.580 --> 00:00:15.180
Witness, prayer, giving,
fasting and pilgrimage.

5
00:00:15.230 --> 00:00:17.610
Each pillar is an act of worship.

6
00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:22.310
So why call them pillars, and what
would fall down if one were missing?

7
00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:25.900
In this mission, you'll read the
words of the declaration of faith,

8
00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:30.020
and see how Sunni and Shi'a Muslims
group their duties differently.

9
00:00:30.070 --> 00:00:34.310
Then you'll ask whether outward actions
mean anything without what lies in the

10
00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:35.410
heart.

11
00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:39.530
Your mission: find out what holds
up a Muslim's life of worship,

12
00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:41.330
and what each pillar adds.
